OL,3,CMeeting to be held on future of
OL,4,C'statistically dangerous' A69
OL,6,FA meeting will be held today on the
OL,7,Ffuture of the A69.
OL,9,FThe trunk road runs across the
OL,10,FPennines between Carlisle and
OL,11,FNewcastle, and it has been criticised
OL,12,Fas being unsafe for HGV use.
OL,14,FITV Border has covered these
OL,15,Fcriticisms over many years, hearing
OL,16,Ffrom residents like Deborah Wearing,
OL,17,Fwho says lorries have collided with
OL,18,Fher home on the road on numerous
OL,19,Foccasions.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G1/7
