PN,32504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F325A1785669497
OL,3,CMeeting to be held on future of
OL,4,C'statistically dangerous' A69
OL,6,FThis would mean the speed limit and
OL,7,Fpedestrian crossings would be locally
OL,8,Fcontrolled, and the Council could
OL,9,Fencourage HGVs to use the A689 - or
OL,10,Feven ban HGVs entirely.
OL,12,FIf National Highways does not agree to
OL,13,Fde-trunk the road, Cllr Dobson is
OL,14,Furging the introduction of interim
OL,15,Fmeasures such as:
OL,17,FWhat does National Highways say?
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G4/7
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,326,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F325A1785669497
OL,3,CMeeting to be held on future of
OL,4,C'statistically dangerous' A69
OL,6,FIn a written response to Cllr Dobson's
OL,7,Fconcerns, National Highways Chief
OL,8,FOperating Officer Duncan Smith said:
OL,9,F"I would like to reassure you that we
OL,10,Ffully appreciate the weight of concern
OL,11,Fwith regards to the A69 through
OL,12,FWarwick Bridge.
OL,14,F"Although the Government has indicated
OL,15,Fthat changing the extents of the
OL,16,Fstrategic road network is not a
OL,17,Fpriority for this Road Investment
OL,18,FStrategy period (2026 ` 2031), we are
OL,19,Fhappy to explore the potential de-
OL,20,Ftrunking of the A69 and trunking of
OL,21,Fthe A689 as a special case.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G5/7
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,326,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F325A1785669497
OL,3,CMeeting to be held on future of
OL,4,C'statistically dangerous' A69
OL,6,F"We are in discussion with Cumberland
OL,7,FCouncil on this matter.
OL,9,F"I can confirm that we are also
OL,10,Freviewing potential measures that may
OL,11,Fdiscourage HGVs from using the A69
OL,12,Fthrough Warwick Bridge. However, it is
OL,13,Fimportant to understand that any such
OL,14,Fmeasures may have an impact on the
OL,15,Fsurrounding local road network."
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G6/7
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
